    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Face the darkness of the past... and uncover the buried secrets.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heritage invites you into an abandoned mansion shrouded in family tragedy and mystery. Set against the backdrop of a relentless storm with pounding rain and crackling lightning, this <strong>psychological horror game</strong> challenges you to uncover a chilling story piece by piece. Explore every shadowy corner, unlock hidden truths, and piece together the fragments of a haunting legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>narrative-driven horror experience</strong> transports you to the mid-1970s, where forgotten memories and unsettling truths await. As you dive deeper, you\u2019ll unravel secrets hidden behind locked doors, cryptic notes, and eerie silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371840/extras/0cd915241d0372b8c8417ecb7faa81e0.poster.avif?t=1734089499\" width=462 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371840/extras/0cd915241d0372b8c8417ecb7faa81e0.webm?t=1734089499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371840/extras/0cd915241d0372b8c8417ecb7faa81e0.mp4?t=1734089499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Awaits You:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Terrifying Mansion:</strong> Illuminate dark rooms, dusty hallways, and forgotten spaces with your flashlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension and Deep Storytelling:</strong> Discover the hidden truth through letters, diaries, and mysterious notes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Sound Design:</strong> Experience the chilling ambiance of rain, distant thunder, and oppressive silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Mysteries:</strong> Follow the clues, solve riddles, and unveil the mansion\u2019s darkest secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Unique Atmosphere:</strong> Feel the ever-present tension of a dark, oppressive environment that keeps you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heritage is a perfect choice for horror enthusiasts looking for a <strong>story-driven</strong>, <strong>atmospheric</strong> experience. With its gripping narrative, immersive environment, and exploration-driven gameplay, it promises hours of suspense and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay vigilant. Every room hides a secret. And the truth lies in the shadows of the past.</strong><br>Can you reach the end of this story, or will the darkness consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371840/extras/42e0d25273406466db3beb375af48b15.poster.avif?t=1734089499\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371840/extras/42e0d25273406466db3beb375af48b15.webm?t=1734089499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371840/extras/42e0d25273406466db3beb375af48b15.mp4?t=1734089499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
